# Controls what `gcloud builds submit` uploads as the build context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
.claude
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
!backend/.env.example
frontend/.env
frontend/.env.*
!frontend/.env.example
frontend/dist
*.log
test_results.txt
frontend/test_results.txt
